# Swift Package Manager
.swiftpm/

# Note: packaging inputs (Scripts/, Packaging/, Tests/Packaging/) are tracked on
# purpose. They define the sandbox entitlements and the release pipeline, so they
# must be reviewable and diffable. A pattern without a leading slash matches at
# any depth — "Packaging/" also swallowed "Tests/Packaging/", which hid the only
# assertion that verifies the app-sandbox entitlement is still present.

# Documentation (local working notes, not published)
/docs/
CONTEXT.md

